en [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]helpers every later phase uses.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rebind existing load-more panels[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]modals[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]modals: switch prompt-history, alias-history, and revive-agent paging to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+J / Ctrl+K with plus-or-minus page-size, not doubling.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Host-owned limit token on every Artifacts pane[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]query-limit[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]query-limit: accept limit:N on every Artifacts dialect, inject it into [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]each pane's default query, and apply it as a post-match cap.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Artifacts Ctrl+J and Ctrl+K[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]artifacts-keys[dim] · [dim][/dim]after query-limit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifacts-keys: bind Ctrl+J / Ctrl+K on the Artifacts tab to raise or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lower the committed limit and grow snapshots when the cap outruns the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loaded page.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-r6","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-r6.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-r6.1"},"source_run_id":"run-d4a68f4f2f22fdc5969b119e239c2476","started_at":"2026-08-19T21:18:44.881275+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"d1945cd8a407f702c3c3a7a31c95e4fb8f11983307877dbdfb7d3d339c98718d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r